[39m←  ☒ Section 1 [38;5;16m[48;5;153m ☐ Soon window [39m[49m ✔ Submit  →

[1m[38;5;231mHow far ahead should a task count as 'due soon' rather than just upcoming?[0m

[38;5;153m❯[39m [38;5;246m1.[39m [38;5;153m24 hours (Recommended)[39m
     [38;5;246mAnything due within a day is highlighted. Good default for a personal task list; a single constant, trivial to [39m
     [38;5;246mchange later.[39m
  [38;5;246m2.[39m 1 hour
     [38;5;246mOnly imminent tasks are flagged. Less noise, easier to miss things.[39m
  [38;5;246m3.[39m 3 days
     [38;5;246mEarlier warning, but more tasks sit in the 'soon' state at once, which dilutes it.[39m
  [38;5;246m4.[39m User-configurable
     [38;5;246mA setting in the UI. Adds a preferences concept and somewhere to persist it.[39m
  [38;5;246m5. Type something.[39m
